WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.773
Define the grade scale

00:00:05.823 --> 00:00:09.107
Open Academics, then Grade Scale.

00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:22.063
To add a higher grade, first lower the top of grade A. Press Edit, set Max to 89.99, and press Update.

00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:31.343
Press Add Grade.

00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:38.645
Enter the grade label, the minimum and maximum percentage, and the grade point.

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:52.917
Press Create. The new grade appears in the list.

00:00:55.898 --> 00:01:00.563
Grade scale updated
